                  </span><br>
                  <img src="templates/millenniumFalcon/images/spacer.gif" height="3"><br>
                  &nbsp;<a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=12738&amp;sid=cc100c4a9f4e9ebb4fb7568cd6a69485"><img src="templates/millenniumFalcon/images/icon_quote_lang.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;
                  </td>
                <td valign="top" class="row2"> <span class="smalltext"><b></b></span>
                  <p><span class="largetext">1.  Saw this coming.  DAoC you had a few character slots but you were locked into one of the 3 sides.  As it is possible to change factions (sides in the war) locking all character slots as one side didn't make much sense.
<br />

<br />
Basicly it's to stop a rebel scum main from using his IMP noob alt to find out where the deathstar is currently parked.  <img src="images/smiles/icon_razz.gif" alt="icon_razz.gif" border="0" />
<br />

<br />
2.  Who the *&%$ wants to be Luke when you can be Han?  Pfft
<br />

<br />
3. I believe mental damage can return normaly it's just some classes will help it return faster.  It is frustrating that they make a big deal pointing out the healing process.  I wish some of these people would play AO.
<br />

<br />
There was no such thing as "down time" sure you had to wait for spawns if you went to some of the static places but there were health and mana "kits".  You could use them roughly every 30 seconds.  They replenished those two precious bars depending on your skills to use them.  Higher skills = more points back when you used them.  They were cheap too and you even found them frequently as "junk loot".  The only real down time was the time it took you to run from your bind point back to your group and the brief period it took your inventory (worn items stayed with you) to appear in the machine right by your bind point.
<br />

<br />
4.  If the space combat is at least as good as Earth Above & Beyond I'm cool with that.  I hope for something closer to XvT but they stated again and again it won't be a "twitch" game.  Booo.  Llamas holding back the cool for us all!
<br />

<br />

<br />
Umm  I want your 2nd key and stuff.  <img src="images/smiles/icon_razz.gif" alt="icon_razz.gif" border="0" />  If you got one that is.  My roomie is taunting me with "maybe I can get one from the guy I work with".  But that ain't panning out.<br />_________________<br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=531009" target="_blank" class="postlink">Palewren Shadowcrest</a></span><span class="smalltext"></span></p>
