                  <span class="smalltext">Site Admin/Designated Ass<br />
                  <img src="images/avatars/gallery/501-600/581.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
                  <br />
                  Joined: 19 Nov 2002<br />
                  Posts: 829<br />
                  Location: Michigan</span><br>
